parser of assistant-ui's private @assistant-ui/markdown package
(packages/markdown/src, everything except its React, Vue, React Native and Ink
renderers, with its tests) and the preprocess helpers of
@assistant-ui/react-markdown (packages/react-markdown/src/preprocess.ts), at
commit 7d7427653f6ba47b0b954510eed9c594d64e74d5. Both are Copyright (c) 2026
AgentbaseAI Inc. under the MIT License reproduced at the top of this file.

